Hi all,




I second Michael’s view. For further context, when I moved from BMW to PCD, I wrote to the BMW committee to tell them that I was no longer running the case. I didn’t receive anything more than an acknowledgement and well wishes.&nbsp;




NOx claimant committee meetings are generally quick, uneventful and friendly. I think that it could be to the detriment of my cases if they found out about my resignation from someone other than me - it feels unnecessarily impersonal.




Matt




































​​​​































