Dear James and Jonathan,

I hope you're well.


I am writing regarding the Pan-NOx Emissions Litigation, specifically regarding the viability of securing additional LOI coverage through further excess
 layer insurance policies.


Following the handing down of the judgment (10th September 2025) after the Second Costs Management Hearing (15-16 July 2025), the Defendants have revisited
 their position on applications for security for costs. We have therefore undertaken a further review of the potential adverse costs resulting from the Tranche 3 Quantum Trial and the Second General Budget.&nbsp;


Previously, our assessment of ATE sufficiency was calculated on the following basis:




60% of the Defendants’ claimed incurred costs;




60% of the Defendants’ claimed budgeted costs; and




100% of approved future costs to Spring 2026.


