o Matt’s email (attached), and we can then prepare a draft?PG – please could you confirm that the other PG CC comms has been sent?&nbsp; A copy of Alessia’s email attaching the draft is attached.&nbsp;JLG:Pallas on standby to assist with any further discussions.&nbsp;Inter partes correspondence:PG – please can you confirm that the responses to the following have been sent (and provide us with copies):&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; i.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; CMS? – Yes, attached&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ii.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Freshfields? – Yes, attached&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; iii.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Cleary? – Not yet, being reviewed by Anna today Also see letter to Signature attached (sent yesterday) Alicia – please let us know your response on the WS / public investigation point.&nbsp; We can then prepare a draft response to Signature. I believe our position is that (i) whether or not it has been reported in the press is irrelevant, and not indicative of whether the fact of an investigation is public knowledge, (ii) Alicia’s statement reflects her own knowledge, which is that the fact of an investigation is publicly known, (iii) in any event, the fact of an investigation is now publicly known between the parties. Would you be able to draft something along those lines for us to consider? Pallas is preparing a draft response to McGuire on (i) ATE and (ii) application costs (see above).&nbsp;Gallagher:We understand the settlement agreement has now been signed. &nbsp;Please let us know if there is any follow up.&nbsp;Insurance &amp; funding queries:Pallas is considering the ATE queries and preparing a draft.Pallas to assist with any update on 10 October update.PG – please can you confirm whether the draft order circulated by Anna yesterday was ever finalised and sealed?&nbsp; If so, please can we have a copy? – No, we do not yet have a finalised, sealed version of the Order although I understand that the latest version is agreed between all parties. I have asked for a copy of this and will forward once I have it. &nbsp;Champerty counsel advice:PG – is there any update from Mark F?&nbsp;External comms:PG – please can you confirm whether FTI has spoken with The Lawyer?&nbsp;Please let us know if anything is missing.&nbsp;Kind regards,James&nbsp;James&nbsp;NewtonAssociateT:&nbsp;+44&nbsp;20&nbsp;4574&nbsp;1016|M:&nbsp;+44&nbsp;78&nbsp;6063&nbsp;5157E:&nbsp;&nbsp;james.newton@pallasllp.com110&nbsp;Bishopsgate,&nbsp;London,&nbsp;EC2N&nbsp;4AYpallasllp.com&nbsp;|&nbsp;LinkedInPallas Partners LLP is a limited liability partnership registered in England with registered number OC437491, and is authorised and regulated by the Solicitors Regulation Authority of England and Wales (“SRA”) with SRA number 826251. A list of names of the members is available for inspection at our registered address at&nbsp;110 Bishopsgate, London, EC2N 4AY.&nbsp;The word “partner” denotes a member of&nbsp;Pallas Partners LLP&nbsp;or an employee or consultant with equivalent standing and qualifications.&nbsp;Pallas Partners (US) LLP is a limited liability partnership established in Delaware and registered in New York, located at 75 Rockefeller Plaza, New York, NY, 10019.&nbsp;Attorneys practicing law with Pallas Partners (US) LLP are admitted to practice in New York and their professional conduct is regulated by the New York Rules of Professional Conduct.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;This email (and any attachments) is confidential and may also be legally privileged and is intended solely for the use of the individual or entity addressed above. If you are not the intended recipient, please immediately notify the sender, then delete it from your system. You should not copy it or use it for any purpose, nor disclose its contents to any other person. Please also note that emails sent or received may be monitored to ensure compliance with the law and with our policies.&nbsp;Further regulatory information can be found in the Legal Notices which appear on our website at&nbsp;https://www.pallasllp.com/legal.​​​​&nbsp;"}

