&nbsp;

In addition, we cannot stress enough how traumatic we and the entire team are finding this process, and that it is happening on the eve of trial. That is exacerbated by the
 fact that we are only properly notified of proposed fundamental changes to our employment through Martyn Day and his team, who as a third party, is not our employer, and where it appears to us these changes are being pushed through as a fait accompli publicly,
