 else at the last minute; andGiven the trial starts in October with summer in between, I anticipate at least some of the trial prep costs will be incurred before the end of July. I expect some tranches of brief
 will be incurred, and there will also be at least some solicitor work (eg I can see there are trial bundle deadlines in July at [52]-[55]).

So, I think the key question is whether or not we can say with confidence that if Cs lose (/ receive an adverse costs order in) T2, that is likely to mean that the T3 trial gets abandoned at the end
