6.21. Additional Co-Counsel Agreements; Additional Insurance Policies; Granting of Contingent Interests in Cases. &nbsp;No Credit Party shall (a) enter into any Co-Counsel Agreement without the prior written consent of the Lender Representative (such consent
 not to be unreasonably withheld, delayed or conditioned) or obtain any additional ATE insurance (or equivalent insurance having a similar effect in any applicable jurisdiction) with respect to the Cases following the Closing Date without the prior written
