 shall grant any party a contingent interest or other payment obligation with respect to any Cases or Case Proceeds without the prior written consent of the Lender Representative, including, but not limited to, a contingent interest in Case Proceeds to a law
 firm or insurance company.&nbsp;




Thanks.

Dilan








