 McF and asked him to do a note for us to consider internally how this may impact us. It's very new judgment that everyone is grappling with.&nbsp;


&nbsp;


The insurers should also be informed of all of this as well though given the Board have been meeting with them, I presume they have kept them up to
 date with the material changes.&nbsp;


&nbsp;


Happy to discuss further and to continue to work on the draft to progress it as far as we can (although I think it's pretty much there now and we need
 Board input to advance it further). Let us know what we can do to help.&nbsp;


&nbsp;


Thanks,


