 disbursement payment to slaughter and may (see row 48 of tab “disbs”) – if this is a share in a particular disbursement, we will need to know what this was.&nbsp; Please can PG clarify as to what date counsel and disbursements fees have been included up to.&nbsp; Counsel’s
 fees in particular to appear low in comparison to the profit costs, therefore, we request that this is checked.
On the fee earner list provided by PG, there were some individuals who were not on the list, therefore, we have taken
 their rates from the ledgers.&nbsp; Where these fee earners were stated to be Grade A, we have assumed that they were to be claiming Grade A3 rate.&nbsp; As such, we recommend that PG review the fee earner tab (“FE”) and confirm that the grades claimed are accurate.

&nbsp;
In respect of what work remains outstanding (in addition to the above, once clarified), we still need to:
