Write a summary and introduction to the breakdownComplete the month-by-month split of the costsWhere fee earners have changed grade, and therefore their rates have increased, we need to reflect this in the breakdown.&nbsp;
 This would likely mean that the profit costs figure will increaseReview any adverse / silent costs orders or summarily assessed costs and remove them from the breakdown
&nbsp;
We will continue working on the above, however, we would be grateful for the above points to be clarified.&nbsp; It may be easier to discuss on a call if required.

